{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-48628","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-56506","text":"OpenSentience Documentation"}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-48630","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-56507","marks":["bold"],"text":"\"Intelligence is not generation. It is structured accumulation.\""}]}],"id":"blk-48629","kind":"quote"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-48632","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-56508","marks":["bold"],"text":"Part of the [&] Protocol stack"},{"id":"spn-56509","text":" · "},{"id":"spn-56510","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/ECOSYSTEM.md"}],"text":"Ecosystem overview"},{"id":"spn-56511","text":" · "},{"id":"spn-56512","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/PULSE/docs/THREE_PROTOCOL_STACK.md"}],"text":"Three-protocol stack"},{"id":"spn-56513","text":" · "},{"id":"spn-56514","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/STACK_COMPLETION.md"}],"text":"Stack status"}]}],"id":"blk-48631","kind":"quote"},{"id":"blk-48633","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-56515","text":"Welcome to the documentation hub for "},{"id":"spn-56516","marks":["bold"],"text":"OpenSentience"},{"id":"spn-56517","text":" — the research arm and runtime governance layer of the [&] Protocol ecosystem."}]},{"id":"blk-48634","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-56518","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-48635","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-56519","text":"What Is OpenSentience?"}]},{"id":"blk-48636","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-56520","text":"OpenSentience is "},{"id":"spn-56521","marks":["bold"],"text":"not a product"},{"id":"spn-56522","text":". It is three things:"}]},{"id":"blk-48637","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-56523","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-56524","marks":["bold"],"text":"A research organization"},{"id":"spn-56525","text":" that publishes cognitive protocols — formal specifications grounding AI agent architecture in cognitive science. 2. "},{"id":"spn-56526","marks":["bold"],"text":"A thin governance shim"},{"id":"spn-56527","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-56528","marks":["code"],"text":"open_sentience"},{"id":"spn-56529","text":" hex package) that enforces permission, lifecycle, and autonomy policies on OTP-supervised agents. 3. "},{"id":"spn-56530","marks":["bold"],"text":"The home of two cross-cutting protocols"},{"id":"spn-56531","text":" — OS-009 PRISM (diagnostic benchmark) and OS-010 PULSE (loop manifest standard) — that sit above the eight cognitive primitives and turn the [&] portfolio into a measurable, composable, accountable agent substrate."}]},{"id":"blk-48638","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-56532","text":"The research output is "},{"id":"spn-56533","marks":["bold"],"text":"ten numbered protocols"},{"id":"spn-56534","text":" organized in two layers:"}]},{"id":"blk-48639","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-48641","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-56535","marks":["bold"],"text":"Cognitive primitives"},{"id":"spn-56536","text":" (OS-001 through OS-008) — one capability each"}]}],"id":"blk-48640","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-48643","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-56537","marks":["bold"],"text":"Cross-cutting protocols"},{"id":"spn-56538","text":" (OS-009 PRISM, OS-010 PULSE) — diagnostic + temporal layers above the primitives"}]}],"id":"blk-48642","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-48644","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-56539","text":"The runtime output includes the Elixir governance package implementing OS-006 (shim) and OS-008 (harness), the "},{"id":"spn-56540","marks":["bold"],"text":"PRISM benchmark engine"},{"id":"spn-56541","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-56542","marks":["code"],"text":"/PRISM/"},{"id":"spn-56543","text":", Elixir/OTP, Fly.io, 6 MCP machines), and the "},{"id":"spn-56544","marks":["bold"],"text":"PULSE manifest standard"},{"id":"spn-56545","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-56546","marks":["code"],"text":"/PULSE/"},{"id":"spn-56547","text":", JSON Schema + reference manifests)."}]},{"id":"blk-48645","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-56548","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-48646","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-56549","text":"The Ten Protocols"}]},{"id":"blk-48647","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-56550","text":"Cognitive Primitives (OS-001 — OS-008)"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-48649","spans":[{"id":"spn-56551","text":"Protocol"}]},{"id":"blk-48650","spans":[{"id":"spn-56552","text":"Name"}]},{"id":"blk-48651","spans":[{"id":"spn-56553","text":"Cognitive Basis"}]},{"id":"blk-48652","spans":[{"id":"spn-56554","text":"Implemented By"}]}],"id":"blk-48648","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-48653","spans":[{"id":"spn-56555","text":"OS-001"}]},{"id":"blk-48654","spans":[{"id":"spn-56556","text":"Continual Learning"}]},{"id":"blk-48655","spans":[{"id":"spn-56557","text":"Hippocampal consolidation"}]},{"id":"blk-48656","spans":[{"id":"spn-56558","text":"Graphonomous"}]}],[{"id":"blk-48657","spans":[{"id":"spn-56559","text":"OS-002"}]},{"id":"blk-48658","spans":[{"id":"spn-56560","text":"Topological Routing (κ)"}]},{"id":"blk-48659","spans":[{"id":"spn-56561","text":"Prefrontal gating"}]},{"id":"blk-48660","spans":[{"id":"spn-56562","text":"Graphonomous routing layer"}]}],[{"id":"blk-48661","spans":[{"id":"spn-56563","text":"OS-003"}]},{"id":"blk-48662","spans":[{"id":"spn-56564","text":"Deliberation Orchestrator"}]},{"id":"blk-48663","spans":[{"id":"spn-56565","text":"Dual-process theory"}]},{"id":"blk-48664","spans":[{"id":"spn-56566","text":"AgenTroMatic"}]}],[{"id":"blk-48665","spans":[{"id":"spn-56567","text":"OS-004"}]},{"id":"blk-48666","spans":[{"id":"spn-56568","text":"Attention Engine"}]},{"id":"blk-48667","spans":[{"id":"spn-56569","text":"Endogenous attention"}]},{"id":"blk-48668","spans":[{"id":"spn-56570","text":"Graphonomous attention module"}]}],[{"id":"blk-48669","spans":[{"id":"spn-56571","text":"OS-005"}]},{"id":"blk-48670","spans":[{"id":"spn-56572","text":"Model Tier Adaptation"}]},{"id":"blk-48671","spans":[{"id":"spn-56573","text":"Resource rationality"}]},{"id":"blk-48672","spans":[{"id":"spn-56574","text":"Graphonomous / Agentelic"}]}],[{"id":"blk-48673","spans":[{"id":"spn-56575","text":"OS-006"}]},{"id":"blk-48674","spans":[{"id":"spn-56576","text":"Agent Governance Shim"}]},{"id":"blk-48675","spans":[{"id":"spn-56577","text":"Executive function"}]},{"id":"blk-48676","spans":[{"id":"spn-56578","marks":["code"],"text":"open_sentience"},{"id":"spn-56579","text":" hex package"}]}],[{"id":"blk-48677","spans":[{"id":"spn-56580","text":"OS-007"}]},{"id":"blk-48678","spans":[{"id":"spn-56581","text":"Adversarial Robustness"}]},{"id":"blk-48679","spans":[{"id":"spn-56582","text":"Immune system"}]},{"id":"blk-48680","spans":[{"id":"spn-56583","text":"OpenSentience security module"}]}],[{"id":"blk-48681","spans":[{"id":"spn-56584","text":"OS-008"}]},{"id":"blk-48682","spans":[{"id":"spn-56585","text":"Agent Harness"}]},{"id":"blk-48683","spans":[{"id":"spn-56586","text":"Supervisory attentional system"}]},{"id":"blk-48684","spans":[{"id":"spn-56587","text":"OpenSentience harness module"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-48685","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-56588","text":"Cross-Cutting Protocols (OS-009, OS-010)"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-48687","spans":[{"id":"spn-56589","text":"Protocol"}]},{"id":"blk-48688","spans":[{"id":"spn-56590","text":"Name"}]},{"id":"blk-48689","spans":[{"id":"spn-56591","text":"Layer"}]},{"id":"blk-48690","spans":[{"id":"spn-56592","text":"Implemented By"}]}],"id":"blk-48686","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-48691","spans":[{"id":"spn-56593","marks":["bold"],"text":"OS-009"}]},{"id":"blk-48692","spans":[{"id":"spn-56594","marks":["bold"],"text":"PRISM"},{"id":"spn-56595","text":" — Protocol for Rating Iterative System Memory"}]},{"id":"blk-48693","spans":[{"id":"spn-56596","marks":["bold"],"text":"Diagnostic algebra"},{"id":"spn-56597","text":" (measures loops over time)"}]},{"id":"blk-48694","spans":[{"id":"spn-56598","marks":["code"],"text":"/PRISM/"},{"id":"spn-56599","text":" Elixir/OTP, Fly.io, 6 MCP machines, "},{"id":"spn-56600","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"https://prism.opensentience.org"}],"text":"prism.opensentience.org"}]}],[{"id":"blk-48695","spans":[{"id":"spn-56601","marks":["bold"],"text":"OS-010"}]},{"id":"blk-48696","spans":[{"id":"spn-56602","marks":["bold"],"text":"PULSE"},{"id":"spn-56603","text":" — Protocol for Uniform Loop State Exchange"}]},{"id":"blk-48697","spans":[{"id":"spn-56604","marks":["bold"],"text":"Temporal algebra"},{"id":"spn-56605","text":" (declares how loops cycle)"}]},{"id":"blk-48698","spans":[{"id":"spn-56606","marks":["code"],"text":"/PULSE/"},{"id":"spn-56607","text":" manifest standard, JSON Schema, reference manifests, "},{"id":"spn-56608","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"https://pulse.opensentience.org"}],"text":"pulse.opensentience.org"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-48699","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-56609","text":"Each cognitive primitive maps a well-established cognitive science finding to a concrete software architecture. The cross-cutting protocols sit above them: PRISM measures how well a closed memory loop performs over time; PULSE declares how any loop in the [&] ecosystem cycles, nests, and signals across boundaries. Both are independent of one another and independent of [&] — a system may adopt one without the others."}]},{"id":"blk-48700","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-56610","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-48701","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-56611","text":"Documentation Map"}]},{"id":"blk-48702","kind":"code","language":"text","text":":maxdepth: 1\n:caption: Homepages\n\n[&] Ampersand Box <https://ampersandboxdesign.com>\nGraphonomous <https://graphonomous.com>\nBendScript <https://bendscript.com>\nWebHost.Systems <https://webhost.systems>\nAgentelic <https://agentelic.com>\nAgenTroMatic <https://agentromatic.com>\nDelegatic <https://delegatic.com>\nDeliberatic <https://deliberatic.com>\nFleetPrompt <https://fleetprompt.com>\nGeoFleetic <https://geofleetic.com>\nOpenSentience <https://opensentience.org>\nSpecPrompt <https://specprompt.com>\nTickTickClock <https://ticktickclock.com>"},{"id":"blk-48703","kind":"code","language":"text","text":":maxdepth: 1\n:caption: Root Docs\n\n[&] Protocol Docs <https://docs.ampersandboxdesign.com>\nGraphonomous Docs <https://docs.graphonomous.com>\nBendScript Docs <https://docs.bendscript.com>\nWebHost.Systems Docs <https://docs.webhost.systems>\nAgentelic Docs <https://docs.agentelic.com>\nAgenTroMatic Docs <https://docs.agentromatic.com>\nDelegatic Docs <https://docs.delegatic.com>\nDeliberatic Docs <https://docs.deliberatic.com>\nFleetPrompt Docs <https://docs.fleetprompt.com>\nGeoFleetic Docs <https://docs.geofleetic.com>\nOpenSentience Docs <https://docs.opensentience.org>\nSpecPrompt Docs <https://docs.specprompt.com>\nTickTickClock Docs <https://docs.ticktickclock.com>"},{"id":"blk-48704","kind":"code","language":"text","text":":maxdepth: 2\n:caption: OpenSentience Docs\n\narchitecture\nquickstart\npositioning\necosystem-overview\ncompetitive-landscape\nharness-engineering\nruntime-walkthrough\ncomparison-table\nresearch\nfaq\nspec/README\nspec/OS-008-HARNESS\nspec/OS-009-PRISM-SPECIFICATION\nspec/OS-010-PULSE-SPECIFICATION\nspec/OS-E001-EMPIRICAL-EVALUATION"},{"id":"blk-48705","kind":"code","language":"text","text":":maxdepth: 1\n:caption: Skills\n\nskills/SKILLS\nskills/01_PROTOCOLS_OVERVIEW\nskills/02_AGENT_LIFECYCLE\nskills/03_PERMISSIONS\nskills/04_AUTONOMY_LEVELS\nskills/05_AUDIT_TRAILS\nskills/06_INTEGRATION\nskills/07_COGNITIVE_SCIENCE\nskills/08_ANTI_PATTERNS"},{"id":"blk-48706","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-56612","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-48707","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-56613","text":"Suggested Reading Order"}]},{"id":"blk-48708","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-56614","text":"If you are new to OpenSentience, follow this path:"}]},{"id":"blk-48709"